# NOTE: config/*.py are TRACKED on purpose - they are the shipped defaults and
# the documentation of every option. Listing them here did nothing (gitignore
# never applies to an already-tracked file) while implying your edits were safe.
# Your own settings belong in user_config.json (ignored below); the control
# panel writes it, config/_overrides.py applies it over these defaults, and the
# in-app updater copies your live values into it before it pulls.
